OL,3,GNEWSAFirst ministers of Wales, Scotland
OL,4,Aand Northern Ireland to meet in Cardiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut there are differences in what they
OL,7,Fare calling for in the immediate term;
OL,8,Fwith Scotland's John Swinney and
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland's Michelle O'Neill
OL,10,Fopenly talking about wanting
OL,11,Freferendums, while in Wales ap Iorwerth
OL,12,Fhas ruled out pushing for one now.
OL,14,FSinn Fein president Mary Lou McDonald
OL,15,Fwill also attend.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
